# Package manager: pnpm only

This repository uses **pnpm** exclusively. Never use `npm`, `yarn`, or `npx` for installs or scripts.

## Commands

| Task | Command |
|------|---------|
| Install (repo root) | `pnpm install` |
| Frontend dev | `pnpm --dir frontend run dev` |
| Frontend build | `pnpm --dir frontend run build` |
| Frontend test | `pnpm --dir frontend run test` |
| Demo recorder | `pnpm --dir scripts/demo run record` |

## Rules for agents

- Do **not** run `npm install`, `npm run`, `npm ci`, or `npx` for project dependencies.
- Add dependencies with `pnpm add --dir <workspace> <pkg>` or `pnpm add -D --dir frontend <pkg>`.
- `preinstall` hooks block non-pnpm installs; keep lockfile at repo root (`pnpm-lock.yaml`).
- Workspace packages: `frontend`, `scripts/demo` (see `pnpm-workspace.yaml`).
